	<section class="section" style="padding-top: 2rem;">
		<h2>At a glance</h2>
		<p class="subtitle">Side-by-side, current as of October 2026 (Stalwart v0.16.25, Mailcow 2026-09a).</p>
		<div class="compare-table-wrap">
			<table class="compare-table">
				<thead>
					<tr><th></th><th>Stalwart</th><th>Mailcow</th></tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					<tr><th scope="row">Architecture</th><td>One Rust binary, every protocol in one process</td><td>Docker Compose, 18 services</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Mail engine</th><td>Written from scratch</td><td><strong>Postfix · Dovecot</strong> (decades in production)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Version</th><td>Pre-1.0 (v0.16.x)</td><td>Regular dated releases (2026-09a)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Runs on</th><td><strong>Linux, macOS, FreeBSD, Windows, or Docker</strong></td><td>Linux with Docker (full VMs; not LXC/OpenVZ)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">RAM, 5–10 users</th><td><strong>~1 GB</strong> (~100 MB idle)</td><td>6 GiB + 1 GiB swap minimum; 8 GiB recommended</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Protocols</th><td><strong>SMTP · IMAP · POP3 · JMAP · CalDAV · CardDAV · WebDAV</strong></td><td>SMTP · IMAP · POP3, plus CalDAV/CardDAV via SOGo</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Webmail</th><td>Not bundled</td><td><strong>SOGo</strong></td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Exchange ActiveSync</th><td>No</td><td><strong>Yes (SOGo)</strong></td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Antispam</th><td>Built-in filter (classifier, Pyzor; LLM on Enterprise)</td><td>Rspamd</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Antivirus</th><td>Via milter (run ClamAV yourself)</td><td><strong>ClamAV bundled</strong></td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Storage</th><td><strong>Pluggable: RocksDB, PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQLite, FoundationDB, S3, Azure, Redis</strong> (read replicas and sharding on Enterprise)</td><td>MariaDB + Dovecot mail storage</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Clustering / HA</th><td><strong>Built in (multi-node, Kubernetes, Swarm)</strong></td><td>Single host</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Directory / SSO</th><td>LDAP, OIDC, SQL; SCIM on Enterprise</td><td>LDAP, OIDC, Keycloak</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Transactional sending API</th><td>No (JMAP submission + event webhooks)</td><td>No (SMTP submission)</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Upgrades</th><td>Manual; minor releases may need config changes or migrations</td><td>Manual <code>update.sh</code></td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Automatic rollback</th><td>No</td><td>No</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">License</th><td>AGPL-3.0 + proprietary Enterprise license</td><td>GPL-3.0</td></tr>
					<tr><th scope="row">Pricing</th><td>Free; Enterprise is a per-mailbox subscription</td><td>Free (paid ServerCow support optional)</td></tr>
